    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109871" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφορ-άω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεῖδον</span> (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>look at from below, eye
				stealthily, view with suspicion</i> or <i>jealousy, suspect,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.4.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί μάτην . . ὑπό μ᾽ ἴδες;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					172
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				11.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Rom.</u>
				8
			</span></i>:— freq. in 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφορῶμαι</span> (aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπειδόμην,</span>
			v. sub voce), in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.7.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				629b10
			</span></i>: folld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.18.8
			</span></i>, etc.: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i><i>D Deor.</i><i><span class="en">
				19.1
			</span></i>.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβλέπω, ὑποψία,
				ὕποπτος.</span></div>
